\title{mortselect: mortality forecasting with selected information borrowing}
\description{
The package collects research implementations for three related mortality
forecasting ideas:
}
\details{
\itemize{
\item deletion-substitution-addition (DSA) selection for choosing auxiliary
populations before fitting an augmented common factor model;
\item age-specific band selection (single- and multi-population versions) for
borrowing information from nearby ages or similar population-age series;
\item bivariate model-based ensembles (BMBE) with augmented common factor and
CBD-type base learners.
}

